{"id":"56c95573-459b-54ae-9b0d-92c23b55fb88","title":"ShowAI Cloud","icon":"☁️","cover":"none","parentId":"884a4104-344d-51e1-a1cd-c1f80f892d20","favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"ShowAI Cloud","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"eyebrow":"官方服务器","title":"不用部署，直接同步和共享","lead":"ShowAI Cloud 是官方运行的项目服务器：不用自己部署，就能在多台设备间同步项目、邀请团队成员。它和自托管服务器使用同一套协议，连接和管理方式完全相同。","facts":[{"label":"服务器地址","value":"showai.renaissancemind.ai/cloud"},{"label":"注册方式","value":"邀请链接或注册密钥"},{"label":"单个对象上限","value":"64 MiB"},{"label":"端到端加密","value":"不提供"}],"actions":[{"label":"团队协作详解","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/project-server","primary":true},{"label":"在 Agent 中使用","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-hosts"}],"art":"concepts"},"integrity":"sha256-7c2bbe84b00357b5e96de32cad51cf6537d38c28d4eadca35435483ba772646e"},"id":"node-a08615d3"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-9f861440"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"连接 ShowAI Cloud"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"添加服务器账号","body":"打开「设置 → 服务器与同步 → 服务器账号」，点「添加服务器账号」，在「服务器地址」填入下面的地址。地址**包含 `/cloud`，不包含 `/api`**。","code":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/cloud","lang":"text"},{"title":"登录，或通过邀请注册","body":"已有账号时选择「登录已有账号」或「使用 Token」；服务器启用了 GitHub、Google 或邮箱验证码时，也会出现这些方式。Cloud 只接受受控注册：没有注册密钥时，请项目管理员发给你邀请链接，在「项目同步 → 加入共享项目」粘贴。**通过邀请注册不需要注册密钥。**"},{"title":"选择要同步的项目","body":"本机已有的项目：在「项目同步」展开它，点「上传到服务器」。服务器上已有的项目：在账号卡片打开「服务器上的项目」，点「加入本设备」。想让以后新建的项目都自动上传，把「新项目默认保存到」设为这个账号。","result":"项目旁显示「已同步」和上次同步时间。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-a28618f9"}},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"用 GitHub 或 Google 登录时为什么要输入完成码","open":false,"id":"node-a1861766"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"授权完成后，浏览器页面会显示一次性完成码和「在 ShowAI 中完成登录」链接。只有发起登录的那个 ShowAI 窗口提交完成码后，服务器才确定账号并签发设备会话，因此即使授权链接被转发给别人，也无法登录你的账号。完成码最多尝试 5 次。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1baa3dc1"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"给已有账号添加或移除 GitHub、Google、邮箱登录，在账号卡片的「账号与设备」里操作，需要最近 15 分钟内直接登录过 Cloud。通过第三方登录创建的账号至少保留一种登录方式。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1aaa3c2e"}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在网页版 ChatGPT 使用 Cloud 项目","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/chatgpt"}}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a4861c1f"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-a3861a8c"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"你的内容怎样经过 Cloud"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"每台设备都保留完整的本机副本，保存不依赖网络。Cloud 运行在 Cloudflare 上，点击节点查看每一部分保存什么。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a6861f45"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-diagram","version":"1.0.0","props":{"initial":"worker","caption":"ShowAI Cloud 的数据流：设备只和 HTTPS 入口通信，元数据与内容对象分开存放","nodes":[{"id":"you","label":"你的设备","sub":"本机内容库","col":0,"row":0,"tone":"brand","icon":"💻","detail":"本机 SQLite 保存全部当前内容和同步基线。离线时照常编辑，联网并完成登录后自动继续同步。"},{"id":"team","label":"成员设备","sub":"各自内容库","col":0,"row":2,"tone":"warm","icon":"👥","detail":"通过 WebSocket 接收推送的项目变化；实时连接断开时，后台定时检查补上。"},{"id":"worker","label":"Worker","sub":"HTTPS 入口","col":2,"row":1,"tone":"teal","icon":"🌐","detail":"处理登录、权限检查和传输。超过 256 KiB 的对象在 Worker 和 R2 之间直接流式传输，不经过元数据库。"},{"id":"meta","label":"元数据","sub":"DO·SQLite","col":4,"row":0,"tone":"violet","icon":"🧾","detail":"账号、设备会话、项目成员与邀请、每个项目的当前 head、配额计量，以及加密保存的模型凭据。小的编辑对象也就近存放在这里，加快读取。"},{"id":"r2","label":"内容对象","sub":"私有 R2","col":4,"row":2,"tone":"slate","icon":"📦","detail":"页面数据、组件包、图片等对象和项目清单。存储桶不公开，只能经过鉴权后的入口读取。"}],"edges":[{"from":"you","to":"worker","label":"HTTPS + WebSocket","both":true},{"from":"team","to":"worker","label":"HTTPS + WebSocket","both":true},{"from":"worker","to":"meta","label":"鉴权与计量","both":true},{"from":"worker","to":"r2","label":"大对象流式读写","both":true}],"groups":[{"label":"ShowAI Cloud（Cloudflare）","from":[2,0],"to":[4,2],"tone":"teal"}]},"integrity":"sha256-9ceb1b83b7337bd71c87cce10635d090629d4226ec970470ceee8ab26cee0038"},"id":"node-a5861db2"}},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"每次发布只携带自当前 head 以来变化的路径，大项目里的一次小修改也只传一点数据；服务器重建并核验完整清单。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9c0af7e3"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-97e0c174"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"上传前先预留配额；中断的上传任务保留 24 小时，可以接着传。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1780cfd8"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-98e0c307"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"超出配额或预算时返回明确错误，"},{"type":"text","text":"本地修改保留","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9258d70d"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-99e0c49a"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a886226b"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"metrics","data":{"title":"Cloud 的默认存储限制","items":[{"label":"每个项目","value":1,"unit":"GiB"},{"label":"每个账号的上传","value":2,"unit":"GiB"},{"label":"单个对象","value":64,"unit":"MiB"},{"label":"单份清单","value":16,"unit":"MiB"}]},"id":"node-a78620d8"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-90122c50"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"和其他服务器一起使用"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你可以同时登录 Cloud 和自己部署的服务器。在「账号绑定」把两边的账号绑定后，新设备登录其中任何一个，就能恢复其他服务器的登录；每个服务器签发自己的有时限设备会话，原始 Token 不会在服务器之间复制。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-91122de3"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"🔗","tone":"sand","id":"node-92122f76"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"绑定会把所选账号的访问权（包括项目和模型资源）交给组内的服务器。"},{"type":"text","text":"只绑定你信任的部署。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 解除绑定会撤销通过对方签发的设备会话；离线的服务器恢复连接后才会完成撤销，设置里会显示待完成状态。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-38b7eeb1"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"id":"node-93123109"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"在服务器上保存模型来源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"内置 Agent 使用的 API Key 或 ChatGPT 授权可以保存在服务器上，供你的其他设备使用："}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9412329c"}},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在「设置 → Agent」的「服务器上的模型资源」点「检索服务器资源」，每个资源都标出来源服务器和账号，选中后点「使用此资源」。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6b77227"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-693f9f90"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已有的本机来源可以通过「将当前来源保存到服务器」保存到选定的服务器。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e0f0acbc"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6a3fa123"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"来源服务器加密保存凭据，在你的设备需要时提供；ChatGPT 授权的刷新也由它负责。来源服务器离线时显示「来源暂时离线」，凭据不会复制到绑定组内的其他服务器。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5bc8b3f1"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6b3fa2b6"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9512342f"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-961235c2"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Cloud 和自己部署有什么不同"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-compare","version":"1.0.0","props":{"highlight":"cloud","columns":[{"id":"cloud","label":"ShowAI Cloud","sub":"官方运行","tone":"teal"},{"id":"linux","label":"自托管 Linux","sub":"Node.js 24","tone":"brand"},{"id":"cf","label":"自托管 Cloudflare","sub":"Workers","tone":"violet"}],"rows":[{"group":"运行","label":"谁负责运维和备份","values":{"cloud":"官方","linux":"你","cf":"你"}},{"group":"运行","label":"元数据存储","values":{"cloud":"Durable Object","linux":"SQLite","cf":"Durable Object"}},{"group":"运行","label":"内容对象存储","values":{"cloud":"私有 R2","linux":"本地磁盘","cf":"私有 R2"}},{"group":"账号","label":"开放注册","hint":"否则需要注册密钥或邀请","values":{"cloud":false,"linux":"可选","cf":false}},{"group":"账号","label":"GitHub / Google / 邮箱登录","values":{"cloud":"由运维方配置","linux":"自行配置","cf":"自行配置"}},{"group":"账号","label":"账号绑定与模型资源","values":{"cloud":true,"linux":true,"cf":true}},{"group":"数据","label":"相同的同步协议与客户端","values":{"cloud":true,"linux":true,"cf":true}},{"group":"数据","label":"存储配额","hint":"默认每项目 1 GiB","values":{"cloud":"默认值","linux":"可调整","cf":"可调整"}},{"group":"数据","label":"端到端加密","values":{"cloud":false,"linux":false,"cf":false}},{"group":"数据","label":"可备份并恢复到 Linux","values":{"cloud":"由官方执行","linux":true,"cf":true}}],"note":"自托管的部署步骤见[项目服务器与团队协作](https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/project-server)，备份与迁移见[服务器运维](https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/operations)。"},"integrity":"sha256-3a5b6ff02c26c6d04060377c93d47041a961d40fcd062e5944842df3976755d0"},"id":"node-97123755"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-981238e8"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"隐私与访问"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"项目内容由项目成员鉴权和 HTTPS 保护，只有项目成员能通过 Cloud 读取。账号 Token 和基础设施的运维凭据相互独立。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-99123a7b"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"🔒","tone":"rose","id":"node-a219046b"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Cloud "},{"type":"text","text":"不提供端到端加密","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：基础设施运维人员可以访问存储的内容和保险库密钥。只把你愿意交给运维方保管的内容同步到 Cloud；需要完全自己掌控数据时，请自托管服务器。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b8d37374"}}]},{"type":"horizontalRule","attrs":{"id":"node-a11902d8"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-a4190791"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"接下来"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":3,"cards":[{"icon":"👥","title":"项目服务器与团队协作","body":"角色、邀请、同步时机和冲突处理。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/project-server"},{"icon":"🤝","title":"在 Agent 中使用","body":"让 Agent 读写已同步到服务器的项目。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-hosts"},{"icon":"🤖","title":"内置 Agent","body":"在页面里对话，选择模型来源。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/built-in-agent"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5892ccd24a456bfe0fa6c6c312635d9b19e4a1bcf063be65ffa1"},"id":"node-a31905fe"}}]},"layout":{},"surfaceViews":{"root":{"initial":null,"saved":[],"readingOrder":["node-a08615d3","node-9f861440","node-a28618f9","node-a1861766","node-a4861c1f","node-a3861a8c","node-a6861f45","node-a5861db2","node-a886226b","node-a78620d8","node-90122c50","node-91122de3","node-92122f76","node-93123109","node-9412329c","node-9512342f","node-961235c2","node-97123755","node-981238e8","node-99123a7b","node-a219046b","node-a11902d8","node-a4190791","node-a31905fe"]}},"comments":[]}